im up.\n  - happiness: Joanna stated she will always remember moments that bring happiness and reminded Nate that it's important to stay happy and de-stress by doing what makes him happy.\n  - fun: Nate found fun by attending a game convention, meeting new people, and planning a gaming session. Joanna emphasized that having fun is important for happiness and de-stressing.\n  - confidence boost: Nate stated that winning was a huge confidence boost and showed his hard work paid off, making him happy with his progress.\n  - moods: Joanna is finding comfort and creativity by tinkering with recipes when in certain moods, which Nate finds satisfying.\n  - playing for fun: Nate likes playing for fun and does not expect to win big.\n  - Nate: Nate enjoys the character Iron Man for his tech and humor. He keeps something in his room that reminds him to work on his goals. Previously, Nate enjoyed walking his dog Max and setting up dog playdates.\n  - Nate: Nate praised Joanna for setting up meetings with movie producers, comparing her success to winning a video game tournament, and expressed pride in her feeling hopeful and inspired.\n  - the path forward: Nate is excited about the future; Joanna previously encouraged Nate not to quit, believing the path forward will show up soon.\n  - Tilly: Tilly is a stuffed animal dog Nate gave to Joanna. Joanna keeps Tilly with her while she writes, and it brings her joy and helps her stay focused.\n  - stuffed animal: Joanna has a stuffed animal dog named Tilly, which Nate gave her. Tilly stays with Joanna while she writes and brings her joy, helping her stay focused.\n  - Nate: Nate won a major Valorant tournament last Saturday, felt strong emotions, and is currently busy preparing for other tournaments.\n  - Nate: Nate made homemade coconut ice cream with sprinkles. His game tournament was postponed, and he didn't make the finals. He creates YouTube gaming content. He expressed support for Joanna filming her movie.\n  - turtles: Nate f