g as a musician"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_3","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_3_qa_179","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"How did Joanna feel on October 25, 2022 about seeing her characters come alive on the big screen?","golden_answer":"surreal and cool","hypothesis":"On October 25, 2022, Joanna felt that seeing her characters come alive on the big screen was amazing and rewarding. She expressed that her characters seemed to jump off the page and become real, and she described the experience as fulfilling, particularly because it was the third time this had happened to her.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Joanna finds seeing her movie come alive to be wild and awesome. (event_time: 2022-11-11T00:06:00Z)\n  - Joanna's characters seemed to jump off the page and become real. (event_time: 2022-10-25T20:16:00Z)\n  - Joanna's favorite part of the experience was seeing the characters she worked hard on come alive. (event_time: 2022-10-25T20:16:00Z)\n  - Joanna experiences happiness and fulfillment from creating stories and watching them come alive. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20:10:00Z)\n  - Nate conveyed that seeing seeing all of the characters and dialogue Joanna wrote being acted out must have been amazing. (event_time: 2022-10-25T20:16:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes her screenplay gets noticed and makes it to the screen. (event_time: 2022-02-25T13:07:00Z)\n  - Movies can make Joanna feel many emotions. (event_time: 2022-10-09T10:58:00Z)\n  - Joanna is finding the