ility, and help during tough times.\n  - Jolene: Jolene attended an awesome yoga retreat where she enjoyed a peaceful setting and an amazing sunrise view. She values catching up with friends like Deborah.\n  - Susie: Jolene mentioned that Susie is a great companion. Jolene has had Susie for two years.\n  - someone close to Jolene: Someone close to Jolene used to bake cookies with her.\n  - new ones: Deborah asked Jolene if she only plays old games or tries new ones.\n  - fate: Jolene stated, \"I already know what fate awaits me if I do this!\"\n  - journey: Deborah encourages Jolene's progress, emphasizing the importance of the journey, self-reflection, and personal joy alongside Jolene's engineering studies.\n  - quotes: Deborah asked Jolene what other quotes give her strength.\n  - Jolene and Anna: Deborah mentioned Anna got her a tasty vegan stir-fry (tofu, veg, ginger, soy sauce). Jolene mentioned doing yoga and meditation last Friday for me-time.\n  - Walking Dead: Jolene and others are planning to play \"Walking Dead\" next Saturday.\n  - Jolene and her partner: Jolene and her partner went scuba diving last Friday and found a cool spot to explore. Jolene also shared a picture of herself and her partner at a music festival last year.\n  - partner de Jolene: Jolene and her partner planned to play console games together.\n  - Jolene's partner: Jolene's partner has values that encourage pursuing creative endeavors. They recently returned from a trip to Rio de Janeiro with Jolene, where they tried yoga classes.\n  - achievements: Jolene is making strides toward her goals, finding it tough but satisfying. Deborah expressed pride in Jolene's achievements and offered help.\n  - joy on the way: Jolene agreed to Deborah's advice to find joy on the way.\n  - Deborah: Deborah enjoyed a music festival, feeling music unites people. She recalls her mother's soothing lullabies and complimented Jolene's tranquil trip photo, highlighting that trips create shared memories.\n  - 