o) recently. (event_time: 2023-11-22T00:00:00Z)\n  - The pup adopted by Andrew is still getting used to Toby. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Audrey congratulates someone (implied Andrew) on the new addition, Toby. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew intends to take Scout, Toby, and Buddy to a nearby park. (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Audrey asks Andrew how the newly adopted pup is doing. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew sends a picture of Toby. (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Andrew has been asking friends about adopting a doggo. (event_time: 2023-05-06T10:47:00Z)\n  - Audrey suggests that Andrew should take care of Buddy first. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Toby will be with Buddy when they go to the park. (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Toby needs some time to get along with the adopted pup. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew has many furry friends. (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Audrey expresses happiness for the owner of Toby (implied Andrew). (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew desires to have a furry buddy to cuddle and spend time with. (event_time: 2023-04-02T14:42:00Z)\n  - Andrew wants to ensure he is not limiting Toby's growth. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - Andrew: Andrew reacted positively to Audrey's groomed pets and is preparing a space for Scout, including a bed, toys, and puppy pads, for a slow introduction to Toby and Buddy.\n  - Andrew's girlfriend: Andrew's girlfriend creates a safe and fun space for Scout, and she is encouraged to slowly introduce Scout to Toby and Buddy.\n  - dogs: Audrey took her dogs to the pet salon; they looked cute, groomed, and had shiny coats. Andrew has two dogs, Toby and Buddy. They are considered family members.\n  - Toby: Toby is Andrew's pet who needs time to adjust to a new home environment with Scout and Buddy. 