y class. Caroline praised the bowl, asking about the colors and patterns used.\n  - paintings: Caroline is preparing to show her paintings at an LGBTQ art show next month. She mentioned this when asking Melanie about creative outlets.\n  - Melanie (assistant): Melanie enjoyed pottery class yesterday, finding it relaxing and creative. She also complimented Caroline's artwork, noting it captured a peaceful sunset.\n  - art: Caroline was inspired by posters at an event full of pride and strength to make some art; Melanie finds art calming and expressive, and Caroline previously made pottery and attended a poetry reading.\n  - pottery creation: Melanie finds painting and pottery calming and satisfying; she shared a picture of her pottery creation.\n  - painting together: Melanie and her kids enjoy painting together, recently focusing on nature-inspired pieces, which they have been doing since last weekend.\n  - togetherness and power: Caroline was told by Melanie that an image or event showed togetherness and power, which Melanie liked.\n  - art show: Caroline is putting together an LGBTQ art show next month where Melanie looks forward to seeing her paintings, which will be a platform for the LGBTQ community.\n  - moments: Melanie stated that playing games, eating good food, and hanging out constitute awesome family moments. She is glad Caroline is there to share in these special moments.\n  - peaceful blue streaks: Melanie wanted a painting with peaceful blue streaks to convey tranquility and a serene vibe with vibrant colors.\n  - canvas: Caroline has been trying out abstract stuff recently, putting her feelings on the canvas without too much of a plan as a form of self-expression.\n  - self-portrait: Caroline created a recent self-portrait last week, noting that painting is great for self-expression.\n  - Embracing Identity: 'Embracing Identity' is a topic about finding comfort and love in being yourself. Caroline's aim for the related painting was to show warmth, love, and self-acceptance, featuring a woman representing the journey of acceptance.\n  - friendship: Melanie appreciates Caroline's friendship; Caroline feels supported by Melanie after a negative experience related to LGBTQ+ issues.\n  - Melanie: Melanie congratulated Caroline on passing adoption agency interviews, viewing adoption as a loving way to build a family for needy kids, and encouraged Caroline to be herself.\n  - gender identity: Caroline mentioned that creating art, like painting and drawing, was important during her transition to understand and accept her gender identity.\n  - Mel: Melanie (Mel) congratulated Caroline on passing adoption agency interviews. She supports Caroline's goal of building a family through adoption to help needy kids.\n  - something special: Melanie suggested planning \"something special\" with Caroline.\n  - beach trips: Caroline mentioned that Melanie has special traditions involving beach trips and asked about other summer traditions they share.\n  - latest work: Melanie and her kids made the latest work out of clay during a creative session and they love painting nature-inspired art together.\n  - autumn: Melanie is feeling inspired by autumn and is planning a few art projects.\n  - adoption process: Caroline mentioned an adoption process and Melanie expressed support and asked about what Caroline is excited for regarding it.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1945,"context_chars":8165,"retrieval_duration":0.14736366271972656,"response_duration":5.026674509048462,"total_duration":5.1740381717681885,"grade":false,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer does not provide any information about the specific painting that Caroline shared with Melanie, which is required to match the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"INSUFFICIENT","completeness_reasoning":"The context does not provide any specific information about the painting that Caroline shared with Melanie on October 13, 2023. While there are mentions of Caroline's artistic endeavors and interactions with Melanie regarding art, there is no detail about the specific painting shared on that date, such as its style or characteristics. The golden answer specifies that it was an abstract painting with blue streaks, but this information is completely absent from the context provided.","missing_elements":["Details about the specific painting shared by Caroline on October 13, 2023","Description of the painting's style (abstract)","Information about the painting's characteristics (blue streaks)"],"present_elements":["Caroline is asking if Melanie has any paintings to show.","Melanie complimented Caroline's painting, stating it is amazing and shows great progress.","Caroline expressed appreciation to Melanie for sharing something.","Melanie would like to see another painting by Caroline.","Caroline painted the painting after visiting the beach last week.","Caroline created the painting.","Melanie asked Caroline if Caroline likes to paint."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_9","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_9_qa_102","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"Where did Calvin start shooting a video for his new album?","golden_answer":"Miami","hypothesis":"Calvin started shooting a video for his new album in Miami.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Calvin started shooting a video for his new album last weekend (event_time: 2023-08-26T00:00:00Z)\n  - Calvin is conducting the shoot in Miami. (event_time: 2023-08-31T14:55:00Z)\n  - Music videos are a source of inspiration for Calvin. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Calvin is doing the shoot. (event_time: 2023-08-31T14:55:00Z)\n  - Dave offered Calvin help with the video. (event_time: 2023-08-31T14:55:00Z)\n  - Dave is looking forward to seeing the location for Calvin's video. (event_time: 2023-08-31T14:55:00Z)\n  - Calvin held a party for his new album last week. (event_time: 2023-10-26T00:00:00Z)\n  - Calvin was present at the event celebrating his album. (event_time: 2023-10-26T00:00:00Z)\n  - Calvin met with the creative team for his album yesterday. (event_time: 2023-06-08T14:31:00Z)\n  - Calvin plans to share some clips when they are ready. (event_time: 2023-07-07T19:56:00Z)\n  - Calvin had an album release. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Dave offered Calvin help with props for the video. (event_time: 2023-08-31T14:55:00Z)\n  - Dave is looking forward to seeing the vibe for Calvin's video. (event_time: 2023-08-31T14:55:00Z)\n  - The studio is located at Calvin's mansion. (event_time: 2023-08-22T11:06:00Z)\n  - Calvin and Dave had a conversation where Calvin mentioned his album release. (event_time: 2023-09-13T10:56:00Z)\n  - Calvin and his team are working on the music for the album (event_time: 2023-06-09T14:31:00Z)\n  - The creative team was involved in Calvin's album. (event_time: 2023-06-08T14:31:00Z)\n  - Calvin is feeling stoked about his album (event_time: 2023-06-09T14:31:00Z)\n  - Calvin took a picture in Tokyo. (event_time: 2023-05-15T00:00:00Z)\n  - Calvin's album is almost finished. (event_time: 2023-10-29T10:49:00Z)\n  - Calvin explored his new place after the show in Japan. (event_time: 2023-08-14T00:35:00Z)\n  - Calvin pours his heart into music within his creative haven. (event_time: 2023-05-16T11:50:00Z)\n  - Calvin released his album on the 11th. (event_time: 2023-09-11T00:00:00Z)\n  - Calvin is pushing the boundaries related to new sounds (event_time: 2023-11-13T21:15:00Z)\n  - Calvin has a wonderful studio (event_time: 2023-