lvin's video and offered help with props.\n  - loved ones: Calvin's family and friends, referred to as loved ones, attended a party at his Japanese house celebrating his new album release.\n  - friends: Calvin shared that friends were present at the party he threw at his Japanese house last week for his new album, showing much love.\n  - photo of the studio: Dave sent a photo of the studio where Calvin's team was working on his album. Calvin mentioned the studio is wonderful.\n  - Dave: Dave congratulated Calvin on his album release and expressed enthusiasm for live music. Dave invited Calvin to see his cool cars in his garage.\n  - ideas: Dave asked Calvin about trying new ideas at his music studio. Calvin is working with new talent and making a beat, which brings new ideas.\n  - creative haven: Calvin refers to his 'creative haven' as the place where he pours his heart into music, following a flood incident.\n  - Dave: Dave congratulated Calvin on his new album party, asked about the cheering, and commented that music can affect mood and help stay on track.\n  - creative team: Calvin met with the creative team for his album yesterday in a long session and felt stoked about the magic they are making in the studio.\n  - studio sessions: Calvin had a few studio sessions last week and is excited to collaborate and share new tunes.\n  - touring: Calvin started touring with Frank Ocean and is enjoying the amazing energy and connection on stage during performances.\n  - new place: Calvin is exploring his new place, which he describes as a dream come true, after finishing a tour with a well-known artist that ended in Japan.\n  - Cal: Calvin (Cal) works with new talent, making a beat for a young artist with great music potential. He enjoys seeing his old friends who support him.\n  - place: Calvin's place was flooded last week, but he saved his music gear and microphone. Previously, Calvin owned a new mansion. Calvin asked Dave about his favorite spot for hanging out.\n  - recordings: Calvin asked Dave if he has any recordings of his recent band jam sessions, noting that such moments sound fantastic.\n  - studio: Calvin's music studio was complimented by Dave. Calvin recorded a song with Frank Ocean there after meeting at a Tokyo music festival; it also has a cozy relaxation room.\n  - Calvin: Calvin had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, feeling a creative high. He and Dave previously planned to meet when Dave is in Boston. Dave has taken up photography.\n  - new stuff: Calvin is trying to find the right balance between sticking to his sound and trying new stuff in his music, finding it exciting and motivating.\n  - shot: Dave took a photograph described by Calvin as a great shot, noting nature's amazing quality.\n  - new sounds: Calvin is having fun trying out new sounds and pushing boundaries, always seeking new ideas to stay ahead.\n  - new ideas: Calvin is making a beat for a young artist, is stoked about working with new talent bringing new ideas to music, and enjoys experimenting and pushing boundaries.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1969,"context_chars":7722,"retrieval_duration":0.16095304489135742,"response_duration":2.357069253921509,"total_duration":2.518022298812866,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer directly states that Calvin started shooting a video in Miami, which matches the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to answer the question. It explicitly states that Calvin started shooting a video for his new album in Miami, which directly corresponds to the golden answer. There are no missing elements, as the location is clearly mentioned in the context.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Calvin started shooting a video for his new album last weekend","Calvin is conducting the shoot in Miami"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_5","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_5_qa_49","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What does Audrey view her pets as?","golden_answer":"Family","hypothesis":"Audrey views her pets as family members, referring to them as her \"fur babies\" and considering them to be more important than anything else in her life. She expresses a strong bond with her pets and believes they bring her joy and companionship.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Audrey considers pets to be like family to people. (event_time: 2023-06-26T13:51:00Z)\n  - Audrey possesses pets referred to as her fur babies. (event_time: 2023-09-24T17:53:00Z)\n  - Audrey considers her dogs to be her universe. (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:32:00Z)\n  - Audrey considers her dogs to mean everything to her. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey wants her pets to feel seen and loved. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Audrey believes that pets like rewards (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Audrey considers her fur kids to be part of her family (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Audrey has a love for her pets. (event_time: 2023-06-26T13:51:00Z)\n  - Audrey appreciates having friends who understand her love for her pets. (event_time: 2023-06-26T13:51:00Z)\n  - Audrey loves her dogs very much. (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Audrey has furry friends. (event_time: 2023-09-06T19:49:00Z)\n  - Audrey has pets. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Audrey states that her dogs are all mutts (event_time: 2023-09-24T17:53:00Z)\n  - Audrey thinks that pets are quick learners (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Audrey's pets have been her companions during all the tough times. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Audrey's pets make Audrey happy. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew observes that Audrey has a strong bond with her pets (implied from previous context). (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Andrew perceives Audrey's dogs as being well loved (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:32:00Z)\n  - Audrey shares a strong bond with her dogs. (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Pets bring a lot of joy to Audrey. (event_time: 2023-07-27T15:52:00Z)\n  - Audrey's dogs, mentioned in a photo, are cute (event_time: 2023-07-27T15:52:00Z)\n  - Pets always leave an impression on Audrey's heart (event_time: 2023-07-27T15:52:00Z)\n  - Audrey has pups. (event_time: 2023-06-02T11:27:00Z)\n  - Audrey has pooches (event_time: 2023-06-26T13:51:00Z)\n  - Andrew thinks it must be great for Audrey to have furry friends. (event_time: 2023-08-16T21:58:00Z)\n  - Audrey intends to strengthen her bond with her pets through the workshop. (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Audrey's friends understand Audrey's love for her pets. (event_time: 2023-06-26T13:51:00Z)\n  - Audrey is busy taking care of her pets (event_time: 2023-05-03T17:41:00Z)\n  - Audrey is spending time with her pets (event_time: 2023-05-03T17:41:00Z)\n  - Audrey has dogs (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - family: Audrey is grateful for her pets, considering them family members, while Andrew also values dogs as amazing furry friends who are always there for them.\n  - joy: Audrey says pets bring much joy. Andrew agrees, mentioning that the pictured pets snuggled up bring joy and fun.\n  - childhood dog: Audrey's childhood dog was named Max, had lots of energy, and loved playing fetch. Pets bring Audrey a lot of joy.\n  - four dogs: Audrey cherishes her four dogs, who always make her smile and give love. She has a tattoo of them and recently returned to the tattoo parlor for more drawings on it.\n  - Audrey's fur babies: Audrey has four fur babies she considers more important than anything. Her existing summary notes they have distinct personalities: relaxed oldest, second likes games, third is naughty but cuddly, and youngest is adventurous.\n  - four fur babies: Audrey has four fur babies that are more important to her than anything else.\n  - animals: Andrew acknowledged the peaceful and joyful nature of animals, referencing potential adventures for Audrey's furry buddies.\n  - Audrey: Audrey took her dogs to the pet salon last Friday, noting they looked cute with shiny coats, behaved well, and were happy and safe.\n  - dogs: Audrey took her dogs to the pet salon; they looked cute, groomed, and had shiny coats. Andrew has two dogs, Toby and Buddy. They are considered family members.\n  - My dogs: Audrey's dogs enjoy meeting new people. They recently had grooming and look soft and fluffy.\n  - furry friend: Audrey took her furry kids to the pet salon last Friday where they were groomed, looked cute with shiny coats, and behaved well. Andrew considers his dogs furry friends and feels lucky to have them.\n  - tags: Audrey made personalized tags for her pets because she wants them to feel seen and loved.\n  - puppies and dogs: Audrey has four doggies that she takes care of to keep them happy and healthy. Andrew mentioned he would not want puppies and dogs to be punished.\n  - outdoors: Audrey misses taking her dogs for walks in nature, calling those moments with her pets in the outdoors chill and happy.\n  - fur kids: Audrey took her fur kids to the pet salon last Friday; they were psyched, looked cute with shiny coats after being groomed, and behaved well. Audrey is grateful for them as family.\n  - groomers: Audrey took her pets to the pet salon last Friday for grooming; they looked cute with shiny coats and behaved well.\n  - exercise: Audrey pets and hugs her dog often for exercise and bonding. Audrey's dog, Precious, was scared, and Audrey calmed her by petting, hugging, and walking slowly.\n  - rewards: Audrey is looking forward to learning how to train her pets better and believes they will learn quickly because they love rewards.\n  - pets: Audrey bought dog toys last Monday. Andrew recently adopted a new puppy who is adjusting to his new home and getting along with Toby. Both find joy in pets.\n  - Audrey's dogs: Audrey took her dogs to the pet salon last Friday for grooming; they looked cute with shiny coats and behaved well there.\n  - Andrew: Andrew reacted positively to Audrey's groomed pets and is preparing a space for Scout, including a bed, toys, and puppy pads, for a slow introduction to Toby and Buddy.\n  - furry buddies: Andrew hopes Audrey and her furry buddies go on some fun adventures soon.\n  - pooches: Pooches moved to a new place with a bigger backyard for running and exploring. Audrey calmed her pooch, Precious, by petting, hugging, and speaking calmly; patience and practice help establish bonds with pooches.\n  - her pups: One of Audrey's pups pulled so hard on the leash last Friday at the park that it busted; she chased and caught the pup. Audrey calmed her by petting, hugging, and speaking calmly.\n  - fur babies: Audrey mentioned she has 'fur babies'. Previously, Audrey got a tattoo of her four dogs, and Andrew asked if she was considering getting more.\n  - neighbors' dogs: Audrey organized a doggy playdate with the neighbors' dogs, and seeing them wag their tails was sweet.\n  - Audrey (assistant): Audrey made an appointment with an animal behaviorist last Wednesday for her dogs who were acting abnormally and received tips to help with their problems.\n  - paws: Audrey pays attention to sensitive areas like ears and paws during gentle grooming, emphasizing patience and positivity.\n  - confidantes: Pets are described as becoming friends and confidantes, always k