luffy.\n  - agility stuff: Audrey set up a doggy play area in her new backyard which includes agility stuff for the pooches.\n  - neighbors: Audrey made goodies recently to thank her neighbors for their pup-friendly homes.\n  - Audrey's dogs: Audrey took her dogs to the pet salon last Friday for grooming; they looked cute with shiny coats and behaved well there.\n  - puppies and dogs: Audrey has four doggies that she takes care of to keep them happy and healthy. Andrew mentioned he would not want puppies and dogs to be punished.\n  - fur babies: Audrey mentioned she has 'fur babies'. Previously, Audrey got a tattoo of her four dogs, and Andrew asked if she was considering getting more.\n  - Jack Russell mixes: Audrey has two dogs that are Jack Russell mixes. They love running and playing fetch. Audrey also has two Chihuahua mixes.\n  - pet salon: Audrey took her four dogs to the pet salon last Friday for grooming; the dogs were excited, looked cute, and behaved well.\n  - dog: Audrey took her four dogs to the pet salon for grooming. Andrew adopted another dog recently, managing with two dogs currently, and asked Audrey for multi-dog owner tips.\n  - neighbors' dogs: Audrey organized a doggy playdate with the neighbors' dogs, and seeing them wag their tails was sweet.\n  - Audrey: Audrey took her dogs to the pet salon last Friday, noting they looked cute with shiny coats, behaved well, and were happy and safe.\n  - pup-friendly: Andrew asked Audrey about plans for making her new place more pup-friendly after the dogs enjoyed the bigger backyard.\n  - personalities: Audrey made items herself, ensuring each one fit the personalities of the intended recipients.\n  - chair: Precious, one of Audrey's four dogs, has a favorite spot to relax: her chair.\n  - city dogs: Audrey's city dogs love trying new parks and trails and go on adventures very often.\n  - dog owners: Audrey meets with a dog owners group once a week for tips and playdates. She considered a positive reinforcement training class workshop advertised at her pet store.\n  - mutts: Audrey has four dogs that are all mutts; two are Jack Russell mixes and two are Chihuahua mixes.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1935,"context_chars":7338,"retrieval_duration":0.14296913146972656,"response_duration":3.3037469387054443,"total_duration":3.446716070175171,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer includes all the items mentioned in the gold answer (dog tags, collars, toys) and adds additional relevant items, which still aligns with the topic of items Audrey has bought or made for her dogs.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all the necessary information to answer the question about what items Audrey has bought or made for her dogs. It includes specific mentions of personalized tags, toys, collars, and implies the presence of dog beds through the context of her care for her dogs. Each item listed in the golden answer is accounted for in the context, making it sufficient to construct a complete answer.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["personalized tags","toys","collars","dog beds"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_9","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_9_qa_103","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What design is featured on Calvin's guitar?","golden_answer":"octopus","hypothesis":"Calvin's guitar features a unique and special design, which includes a gorgeous shiny purple hue. Additionally, it reflects Calvin's artistic style and has been customized with small details to make it unique and personalized.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps i