_graph_9","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_9_qa_119","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What does working on cars represent for Dave?","golden_answer":"Therapy and a way to get away from everyday stress","hypothesis":"Working on cars represents therapy and relaxation for Dave. He finds it therapeutic and calming, allowing him to connect back with himself and escape from everyday stress. Additionally, he derives a sense of fulfillment and purpose from refurbishing and restoring cars, viewing it as an outlet for self-expression.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Dave finds working on cars to be therapeutic. (event_time: 2023-05-31T18:06:00Z)\n  - Dave is passionate about working on cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave finds working on a car to be therapeutic and relaxing (event_time: 2023-10-04T14:44:00Z)\n  - Dave is currently working on his latest car project. (event_time: 2023-10-25T20:25:00Z)\n  - Refurbishing cars gives Dave a sense of fulfillment. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Dave is involved in working on cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave is currently working on a new car that presents a challenge. (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Dave considers fixing cars to be like therapy for him. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Dave has a dream of working on classic cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave is currently working with cars. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave works on all kinds of cars at his shop. (event_t