ts.\n  - dog: Joanna previously had a dog named Tilly in Michigan, but had to give it up due to allergies. Nate has turtles that cheer him up.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie and showed interest in the coolest moment on set. He also wished her well for her filming experience.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1935,"context_chars":7285,"retrieval_duration":0.18038272857666016,"response_duration":2.1041057109832764,"total_duration":2.2844884395599365,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer specifies a date in May 2022, which aligns with the gold answer's reference to May 2022.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides a specific date when Nate adopted Max, which is May 20, 2022. This date directly answers the question about when Nate adopted Max, aligning perfectly with the golden answer provided. All necessary information is present and clearly stated in the context.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Nate acquired a new addition to the family named Max. (event_time: 2022-05-20T19:49:00Z)"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_7","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_7_qa_41","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What ways do Deborah and Jolene use to enhance their yoga practice?","golden_answer":"candles, music, essential oils","hypothesis":"Deborah and Jolene enhance their yoga practice in several ways:\n\n1. **Candles and Scents**: Deborah bought a candle to improve her yoga practice, using scents like lavender and rosemary to create a serene atmosphere. Jolene also uses candles to create a calming space during her yoga sessions.\n\n2. **Essential Oils**: Deborah incorporates essential oils into her practice, which she finds helpful for creating warmth and calm. Jolene similarly uses essential oils and soft music to enhance her meditation and yoga experience.\n\n3. **Mindful Breathing**: Deborah recommends practicing mindful breathing as a technique to improve yoga practice.\n\n4. **Instrumental Music**: Deborah finds instrumental tracks with mellow melodies and rhythms beneficial for creating a peaceful vibe during her yoga sessions.\n\n5. **Environment**: Both Deborah and Jolene recognize the importance of the environment in enhancing their yoga practice. Deborah specifically mentions that the environment can enhance the practice.\n\n6. **Yoga Routines and Classes**: Deborah has a favorite yoga routine and teaches yoga classes, which helps her and her students connect and improve their practice. Jolene is also exploring new routines and poses to enhance her experience.\n\n7. **Mindfulness Practices**: Both engage in mindfulness practices, with Deborah organizing mindfulness workshops and Jolene incorporating mindfulness into her self-care routine.\n\nThese methods collectively contribute to a more enriching and effective yoga practice for both Deborah and Jolene.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Deborah bought the candle to improve her yoga practice. (event_time: 2023-03-28T16:03:00Z)\n  - Deborah uses yoga to help find balance and inner peace. (event_time: 2023-08-21T09:11:00Z)\n  - Deborah participates in yoga and meditation with others. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah recommends practicing mindful breathing for yoga. (event_time: 2023-06-06T15:56:00Z)\n  - Deborah offered Jolene help with her mindfulness workshops and reading. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah finds instrumental tracks with mellow melodies and rh