hed, resulting in the loss of all her work.\n  - Joanna: Joanna is filming her own movie based on her road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and is excited to show her vision.\n  - presentation: Joanna finished the presentation for movie producers last Friday after working on it; she found it tough but it is looking good.\n  - page: Joanna described seeing characters she wrote jump off the page and become real on the big screen, which was the third time this has happened.\n  - writing gig: Joanna had an audition yesterday for a writing gig, feeling a mix of excitement and anxiety afterward. Nate previously encouraged her, noting her hard work and passion.\n  - idea: Joanna is looking forward to trying out Nate's ideas for character creation after seeing her own written work performed.\n  - creations: Joanna is proud of Nate's creations and complimented his gaming room. Nate is focusing on gaming and recently won a tournament.\n  - progress: Joanna is determined to keep grinding and moving ahead despite writing difficulties, after losing all her work progress when her laptop crashed. Nate expressed sympathy.\n  - journey: Joanna values the journey, appreciating happy moments to stay focused on dreams, and looks forward to showing it to Nate.\n  - hard work: Joanna found seeing her hard work in writing a movie script acted out on the big screen a surreal and satisfying experience, the third time this has happened.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2015,"context_chars":8284,"retrieval_duration":0.16689300537109375,"response_duration":1.9387648105621338,"total_duration":2.1056578159332275,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer mentions both a film contest and a film festival, which are the same places referenced in the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to answer the question about where Joanna has submitted her work. It explicitly states that Joanna submitted 