h that brings joy is Calvin's motivation for growth, as felt during his album party celebration.\n  - music: Calvin and an artist discussed favorite artists, art, and music's power to connect people, leading to a creative high for Calvin. Dave also noted music fosters creativity.\n  - helpful people: Calvin values supportive people for artist development and motivation, recalling how relationships sparked feelings similar to when he and friends freestyled as teenagers.\n  - Calvin: Calvin had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, feeling a creative high. He and Dave previously planned to meet when Dave is in Boston. Dave has taken up photography.\n  - favorite artists: Calvin and an artist discussed their favorite artists, art, and the power of music during an inspiring conversation at a Boston gala.\n  - art: Calvin discussed art and music with a cool artist at a Boston gala, feeling creatively inspired. He is also making a beat for a young artist and pushing boundaries in his own art.\n  - notebook: Dave stated that writing lyrics and notes in a notebook boosts his motivation to grow.\n  - music gear: Calvin saved his music gear and favorite microphone during a flood last week. Dave offered Calvin help with his music stuff and mentioned his own music studio setup with a high-quality sound system.\n  - ideas: Dave asked Calvin about trying new ideas at his music studio. Calvin is working with new talent and making a beat, which brings new ideas.\n  - current events: Calvin values staying connected to world events to inspire his music and better connect with fans, despite the challenges of his job.\n  - Dave: Dave congratulated Calvin on his album release and expressed enthusiasm for live music. Dave invited Calvin to see his cool cars in his garage.\n  - music scene: Calvin toured with Frank Ocean, finding the Tokyo crowd insane. He is excited about the music scene and Dave will cheer him on in Boston.\n  - creative haven: Calvin refers to his 'crea